main  = (⠶expr ∨ 󰆴𝗪)*
expr  = asgn ∨ or ∨ and ∨ unary
asgn  = 𝚟 󰆴(𝗪?'='𝗪?) ⠶expr
and   = ⠶unary 󰆴(𝗪?'∧'𝗪? ∨ 𝘄?) (⠶and ∨ unary)
or    = (⠶and ∨ unary) 󰆴(𝗪?'∨'𝗪?) (⠶or ∨ unary)
unary = ~‹[¬⮞󰆴⠶]*› ⠶(atom ∨ grp) ~‹[+*?]*›
atom  = ☾_ƒ ∨ ☾_λ ∨ rgx ∨ str ∨ 𝚟
str   = ⠶(str1 ∨ str2 ∨ str3 ∨ str4)
☾_ƒ   = 󰆴'〔' (~‹[^〕␛␛]+›  ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹[〕␛␛]›  ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴'〕'
☾_λ   = 󰆴'󰅁' (~‹[^󰅂␛␛]+›  ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹[󰅂␛␛]›  ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴'󰅂'
rgx   = 󰆴'≁' (~‹[^≁␛␛]+›  ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹[≁␛␛]›  ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴'≁'
str3  = 󰆴'‹' (~‹[^␛›␛␛]+› ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹[␛›␛␛]› ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴'›'
str1  = 󰆴'"' (~‹[^"␛␛]+›  ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹["␛␛]›  ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴'"'
str2  = 󰆴‹'› (~‹[^'␛␛]+›  ∨ 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹['␛␛]›  ∨ ~‹␛␛›)* 󰆴‹'›
str4  = 󰆴‹␛␛› ~‹[^\n]›
grp   = 󰆴('('𝗪?) ⠶expr+ 󰆴(𝗪?')')
𝚟     = ~‹[^[\](){}〔〕≁+*?∧∨="'\t\n ‹␛›␛␛]+›
𝘄     = (~‹[ \t]›   ∨ 󰆴(~‹␛␛\n›))+
𝗪     = (~‹[ \t\n]› ∨ 󰆴(~‹␛␛\n›))+

